api.simRunInstructions:
1. Activate the conda environment: conda activate MiroFish
2. Run the simulation (the scripts are in {scripts_dir}):
   - Twitter only: python {scripts_dir}/run_twitter_simulation.py --config {config_path}
   - Reddit only: python {scripts_dir}/run_reddit_simulation.py --config {config_path}
   - Both platforms in parallel: python {scripts_dir}/run_parallel_simulation.py --config {config_path}
